/*
 * Implements semantic validation for class destructors.
 *
 * This module handles:
 *   - validation of destructor prototypes,
 *   - inheritance of ancestor destructors,
 *   - detection of movable-field requirements for implicit destructors,
 *   - synthesis of default destructors when required,
 *   - integration of destructor values into the ClassRefType,
 *   - insertion of destructor symbols into the class's add-method list.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::symbol::class_::dtor
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/symbol/class_/dtor.yr
 * @Author(s):
